ild the next ‘wayve’ in autonomous vehicles on the following channels: Twitter​: @wayve_ai LinkedIn​ YouTube Technology, Milestones &amp; More on our Company Blog Are you actively looking for your next opportunity? We understand emails like this can be deflating and we don’t want them to be. While this particular opportunity was not a fit, we appreciate your interest in us and want to do what we can to help you in your search. Below are some job search resources we’ve curated that you might find helpful - blogs, tips, etc. We hope they may be of use. Tips &amp; Best Practices The Muse: Researching Potential Employers Undercover Recruiter: Tips for Finding Job Search Success LifeHacker: Targeting Key Employers Why You Got Rejected We hope you find these resources helpful. Please feel free to respond to this email if you would like more feedback, or check back with us again in the future for new opportunities with Wayve. We wish you all the best in the meantime!</p>','2025-10-25 23:23:04','https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=62eknLwTdFM'),(2364,592,'Instawork’s','client','vhuynh@instawork.com',NULL,NULL,'2025-08-26','Virtual','Technical','','https://1drv.ms/t/c/03d6ab5c09c86fb5/EXu3N50VK1hDv_KMI-cnR_MBgNnHib1XsVm5txrNGMsN7g?e=6sGcl7',NULL,'Pending','<p>Technical R1</p>','2025-10-23 17:17:23',NULL),(2365,570,'Spotter ','client','ashleigh.wilantt@spotter.la',NULL,NULL,'2025-08-29','Phone','Recruiter Call','',NULL,'https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/spotter/jobs/4597110005?gh_src=b6b293c15us','Positive','<p>Scheduled Technical, Call</p>','2025-10-25 23:16:24',''),(2366,691,'partners',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-07',NULL,NULL,'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1er8pnsifOo_BBa8ioRhb_OksUFyb6axP/view?usp=drive_link',NULL,NULL,'Pending',NULL,'2025-10-08 21:12:54',NULL),(2367,691,'SoftBank',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-02-07',NULL,NULL,'https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H1e27u2tG6Ph2BZBOMGJ9UKVFGh2pgoo/view?usp=drive_link',NULL,NULL,'Pending',NULL,'2025-10-08 21:12:54',NULL),(2368,691,'