l\" color=\"#000000\">9+\r\nyears of IT (QA) experience within a wide variety\r\nof projects and environments. Experience in writing Master Test Plans, Test\r\nStrategy, Estimating/Planning/Monitoring testing schedules, creating Test\r\nSummary Reports, Traceability Matrix, imparting\r\nprofessional training/mentoring in software testing theories, procedures and\r\nmethodologies. Well versed with writing and executing test cases in highly\r\nstructured development environments and performing all types of testing\r\n(Functional, Integration, Regression, System Testing, User Acceptance Testing,\r\nCompatibility, Reliability, Exploratory/Ad Hoc, Load, Stress and Performance\r\ntest (using tools HP Quality Center, Rational Functional Tester,\r\nRational Performance Tester, Rational Clear Quest, Rational Clear\r\nCase, Test Manager (WinRunner), LoadRunner, Toad, SQL Query Analyzer,\r\nCrystal/Cognos reports and lotus based UVATS). <o:p></o:p></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText3\"><o:p><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Strong\r\n     in Analyzing Business Specification/Requirements, developing Master\r\n     Test Plans, Test Strategy, Estimating/Planning/Monitoring\r\n     testing schedules, writing Test Summary Reports and Traceability\r\n     Matrix.<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Ensure\r\n     proper resource planning for assigned activities and assigning the\r\n     workload to resources. <o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Imparting\r\n     professional training/mentoring in software testing theories,\r\n     procedures and methodologies.<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Maintaining test execution\r\n     status, reports and defect tracking power curve excel sheets.<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Responsible for the project\r\n     defect management (Defect Status, Root Cause, Daily Triage Meeting).<o:p></o:p></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Proficient\r\n     in reviewing test cases/test scripts, writing/executing test\r\n     cases/test scripts, recording results, creating Test Reports and doing\r\n     Defect Tracking (using HP Quality Center, Rational Clear Quest, Merant\r\n     Tracker and ViewPoint Fuse Version1).<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Well\r\n     versed with performing Functional, Integration, Regression, System\r\n     Testing, UAT, Compatibility, Reliability, Exploratory/Ad Hoc, Load, Stress\r\n     and Performance test (using tools HP\r\n     Quality Center, QTP, RFT, RPT, Clear Quest, Clear Case and LoadRunner.<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Leading/reviewing the <span style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">iOS/Android</span><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"> functional testing process and test case\r\n     creation for iOS/Android Devices.<o:p></o:p></span></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Monitoring mobile SMS program testing on (iOS,\r\n     Android) devices.<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Performing/monitoring\r\n     functional/usability testing of mobile sites/apps in Mobile testing\r\n     platform Keynote’s Device Anywhere..<span style=\"background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Proficient\r\n     in performing backend database testing using Toad, AQT (Advanced\r\n     Query Tool), IBM DB2’s (Control Center) and SQL Query Analyzer.<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Participating in Production\r\n     Support testing by taking on-call responsibilities.<span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Used agile/scrum\r\n     test methodology for testing, well aware of <span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n     .2pt\">CMMI Maturity levels</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:.2pt\">\r\n     and process areas.</span><o:p></o:p></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\">Ability\r\n     to work with development and cross-functional teams to resolve critical\r\n     design, functional issues and managing communications in a timely manner\r\n     to appropriate levels, and escalating issues as needed. Communicating to\r\n     all levels of Management (Development/QA/Operations/Design/Customer\r\n     Support) at all locations (including International).</span><o:p></o:p></font></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\" face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Flexible\r\n     and resourceful, apply strong organizational, time-management and planning\r\n     skills to deliver projects on time despite intense pressure and aggressive\r\n     timelines.<o:p></o:p></font></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"arial\" color=\"#000000\">Ability\r\n     to work under strict deadlines, highly organized and goal-oriented.</font><font color=\"#000000\"><o:p></o:p></font></font></span></li>\r\n</ul></div>		','recruiterassesment','N','N','http://www.innova-path.com/uploads/1382_MeenaSingh_QA Lead.doc','2014-08-08 10:10:00','2024-11-14','N',13,'Y',NULL,NULL,NULL),(281,'Sandeepa Mohanty','2014-08-12','sandeepa.mohanty@gmail.com','QA','650-740-3279','Break','GC','Masters in Biological Science from California State University, East Bay Hayward.','No','619-67-0234','N','N','N','N','0000-00-00','N','sandeepa_das@yahoo.com','9252362054','2134, Maidenhair Way, San Ramon, CA- 94582','San Ramon','CA','USA',' 94582',NULL,'1982-07-26','Sudhashree Das','','248 705 2636','2494 Lone Oak Dr,San Jose, CA 95121','N','N','N','',675.00,0.00,'','','','','','','http://goo.gl/hn1I6j','http://goo.gl/KVebx4','http://goo.gl/g723xk','http